  "body": "Architecturally designed in 2010, this premium elevated coastal property is perfectly positioned to make the most of its magnificent sea views. Timeless in appeal, this impressive freehold four-bedroom, four-bathroom home offers a wonderful sense of space, flexibility and connection to the sea from every level. Expansive floor to ceiling windows flood the interiors with natural light, framing the ever-changing vistas of the Hauraki Gulf. Immaculately presented with multiple living spaces, this incredible family home has a lot on offer. \r\n\r\nThe top level offers a wonderful penthouse feel with the open-plan living, dining and kitchen taking full advantage of the spectacular outlook.  From this area, doors open to a private, sunny rear courtyard, complete with established fruit trees. Peaceful and quietly tucked away, it's a lovely spot for an afternoon coffee, entertaining friends or simply enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nThe principal suite on this level feels like a retreat, complete with generous walk-in wardrobe and ensuite featuring a spa bath. You will be waking to the sun rising over the water or settling in at the end of the day as the sea changes with the light. \r\n\r\nAt the mid-level, you'll find three generous bedrooms, an ensuite, the family bathroom and a second lounge enjoying breathtaking views over the Hauraki Gulf. This is a great setup for families, teenagers who need their own space, or extended family living.  \r\n\r\nThe lower level provides an internal double garage and a versatile small studio with its own bathroom. Whether you need a dedicated work-from-home office space, art studio, gym, or simply extra storage, this is a valuable addition that can adapt as your needs change.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Coastal walkways are right on your doorstep, with Churchill Cove just a few minutes' walk away, giving you easy access to some of the area's most beautiful seaside spots. Zoned for excellent schooling including Rangitoto College, this home is a must see.",
